{"author":["Elastic"],"description":"检测Windows创建隐藏本地用户。对应需求：持久化。官方：Creation of a Hidden Local User Account。","from":"now-9m","index":["winlogbeat-*","logs-endpoint.events.registry-*","logs-windows.sysmon_operational-*","endgame-*","logs-m365_defender.event-*","logs-sentinel_one_cloud_funnel.*","logs-crowdstrike.fdr*"],"language":"eql","license":"Elastic License v2","name":"【默认】Windows创建隐藏本地用户","references":["http://web.archive.org/web/20230329153858/https://blog.menasec.net/2019/02/threat-hunting-6-hiding-in-plain-sights_8.html","https://github.com/CyberMonitor/APT_CyberCriminal_Campagin_Collections/tree/master/2020/2020.12.15.Lazarus_Campaign"],"risk_score":73,"rule_id":"2edc8076-291e-41e9-81e4-e3fcbc97ae5e","severity":"high","tags":["操作系统: Windows","主题: 持久化","来源: 默认","对应需求: 持久化"],"timestamp_override":"event.ingested","type":"eql","query":"registry where host.os.type == \"windows\" and event.type in (\"change\", \"creation\") and\n  registry.path : (\n    \"HKLM\\\\SAM\\\\SAM\\\\Domains\\\\Account\\\\Users\\\\Names\\\\*$\\\\\",\n    \"\\\\REGISTRY\\\\MACHINE\\\\SAM\\\\SAM\\\\Domains\\\\Account\\\\Users\\\\Names\\\\*$\\\\\",\n    \"MACHINE\\\\SAM\\\\SAM\\\\Domains\\\\Account\\\\Users\\\\Names\\\\*$\\\\\"\n)\n","note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\nWindows创建隐藏本地用户\n\n### 为何重要\n在重启或登录后保持立足点\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 核对告警实体、进程/网络字段与时间窗。\n2. 核对是否符合变更窗口与已知业务工具。\n3. 关联同主机或同账号前后同类告警。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则隔离相关主机或账号并排查落地与外连。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后同类告警。\n","setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 目标 Windows 主机安装 Elastic Agent，启用 **Elastic Defend**（按规则需要进程/网络/文件/注册表或安全日志）。\n2. 确认相关数据流有数据后再评估告警。\n","investigation_fields":{"field_names":["@timestamp","host.name","user.name","user.id","process.name","process.parent.name","process.executable","process.command_line","event.action","event.code","file.path","registry.path","source.ip","destination.ip","message"]},"threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1136","name":"Create Account","reference":"https://attack.